<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29970" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγηρ-άσκω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Lib.
			<u>Or.</u>
			61.9
		</span></i> (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγηρ-άω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Anon.
			<u>in EN</u>
			237.2
		</span></i>), fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άσομαι [ᾱ</span>]
		(v. infr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grow old
				with</i> or <i>in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγέθει σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					2.54
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς βασιλείαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.7.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				11.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>grow old in one, decay</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐπιστήμην ἐγγηράσεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὶν ἐγγηρᾶσαι τὴν ἀκμὴν τῆς
					ἐλπίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Nic.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
